# Agent Development Policy Adapter (Cursor)

This file contains only Cursor-specific loading metadata and references. It is not a semantic source of truth.

Before development or investigation, follow the canonical files declared by
`ai_tool/policy/development_policy.json` under `distribution.canonical_files`, including:

- `docs/AI_DEVELOPMENT_SESSION_START_POLICY.md`
- `docs/DEVELOPMENT_TEST_POLICY.md`
- `docs/GIT_OPERATION_POLICY.md`
- `ai_tool/policy/git_governance.json`
- `docs/CURRENT_DEVELOPMENT_STATE.md`

If this adapter conflicts with a canonical file, the canonical file takes precedence. Do not copy common policy
semantics back into this adapter; update the appropriate canonical source instead.
